Package: bacha
Title: Bias adjusted aggregation of chromatin accessibility data
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Tim", "Stuart", , "stuartt@a-star.edu.sg", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Ting Wei", "Lim", , "Lim_Ting_Wei@a-star.edu.sg", role = c("aut"))
    )
Description: Bacha estimates the chromatin accessibility for a collection of sites in the genome (for example, transcription factor motif sites) and computes an accessibility score per cell normalized to a set of background control regions matched for GC content and sequence entropy by default.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
